            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jenni_fer"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This salad was really good, I thought of adding dried cranberries but decided against it, I did add chicken for some protein. While I was eating it the first time I thought cheese of some kind would be nice. The second time I made it I added some crumbled Wensleydale that had cranberries in it - perfect addition.",
            "datePublished": "2013-04-16T14:53:00.757Z"
